                                                "sense_id": "5033c5ed-4438-36c7-8989-76afa8da1558",
                                                "text": "When Kafka’s novels are analyzed with the autistic frame of reference in mind the behavior of his protagonists make more sense and will reveal that Kafka’s protagonists focus on external behavioral cues which are guided by Kafka’s education and mindset of a lawyer."
